      "content": "hey... i don't really know how to start this. it's been three weeks since i told my parents i'm gay and they basically told me to leave. like, get out. my mom cried and said she'd pray for me and my dad just looked at me like i was a stranger. i'm staying at my friend's place now but i just feel like... i've been erased? like i never existed to them. i don't think i can exist in a world where the people who made me don't want me",
